      "content": "thanks. i like the points but i'm struggling with the 'balancing' part. some of the older residents are really worried that if we focus too much on 'cultural exchange' and being 'inclusive,' the actual historical identity of the town will just get diluted or erased by the new influences. it feels like you can't really do both effectively. do you think it's more realistic to prioritize protecting the existing heritage first, or should the report focus on how the town can evolve to include these new groups?",
